This repository contains the original illustration-cleanup skill and its
pipeline. It is not an installer for an upstream skill.

At runtime, the pipeline installs third-party packages from PyPI and downloads
model weights from their upstream release URLs. Neither the packages nor the
model weights are redistributed in this repository.

